n?",add_text_description:"Your members will see this text in the app, as one of their daily study activities. \n\nThis is great for sharing your thoughts or guiding members.\ud83d\udca1 Some great examples are a short devotional, instructions for a prayer meditation, or a challenge for your members. ",add_video_description:"Adding video is a great way to supplement your study. Whether it\u2019s a commentary  or devotional you film yourself, we have found this can help your group understand what they\u2019re studying even more. \n\nTap next to add a video to your study \ud83d\udc47","already have account":"Already have an account?",back:"back","back block":"Are you sure you want to back?\nYour changes will not be saved!","bible complete message":" \ud83c\udf89 You did it! You finished \u201c%{name}\u201d","bible completed":"Bible Study Complete! ",build_habit_content:"With {{org_name}}, you\u2019ll see how easy Bible reading  becomes when you have a community to motivate and encourage you along the way!",cancel:"cancel","change group avatar":"Change group avatar","change success":"Change group picture successful!",day:"day",days:"days",weeks:"weeks",delete_account_confirm:"You are about to delete your {{appName}} account and all of its data. This step cannot be undone, do you wish to proceed?",discuss:"discuss","discuss readings and more each day":"discuss readings & more each day","doing the daily journey together":"doing the daily journey together","email-different-device":"It looks like you're trying to login using a different device \ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\nPlease re-enter your email address to log in.","empty review title":"Here\u2019s your weekly review! \u2728","enter verse range":"enter verse range \u2026",feedback_content:"We\u2019ll use everything you tell us to build a better {{appName}}.",feedback_header:"Send us your ideas, issues hopes or dreams \u2728",feedback_success:"Feedback submitted \ud83d\udce3","full review title":"Here\u2019s all the cool things yo