ecting various scriptures and activities for your group":"X\xe2y d\u1ef1ng k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch t\u1eeb \u0111\u1ea7u b\u1eb1ng c\xe1ch ch\u1ecdn c\xe1c th\xe1nh th\u01b0 v\xe0 ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng kh\xe1c nhau cho nh\xf3m c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n","Build bible together":"C\xf9ng nhau x\xe2y d\u1ef1ng th\xf3i quen Kinh Th\xe1nh h\xe0ng ng\xe0y","Build bible together desc":"B\u1ea1n s\u1ebd th\u1ea5y vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u1ecdc Kinh Th\xe1nh tr\u1edf n\xean d\u1ec5 d\xe0ng nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\xe0o khi b\u1ea1n c\xf3 m\u1ed9t c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ed9ng vi\xean v\xe0 khuy\u1ebfn kh\xedch b\u1ea1n trong su\u1ed1t ch\u1eb7ng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng - h\xe3y c\xf9ng tham gia!","Building a plan for your group":"X\xe2y d\u1ef1ng k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch cho nh\xf3m c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u26a1\ufe0f","Building communities for college campus students":"X\xe2y d\u1ef1ng c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng cho sinh vi\xean tr\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u1ea1i h\u1ecdc","Can you pray for":"B\u1ea1n c\xf3 th\u1ec3 c\u1ea7u nguy\u1ec7n cho",Cancel:"H\u1ee7y b\u1ecf","Cancel study":"H\u1ee7y b\u1ecf nghi\xean c\u1ee9u","BibleDept is possible thanks to donations from people like you":"C\xf3 th\u1ec3 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nh\u1edd s\u1ef1 \u0111\xf3ng g\xf3p t\u1eeb nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi nh\u01b0 b\u1ea1n.",Casual:"B\xecnh th\u01b0\u1eddng","Celebrate with":"K\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m v\u1edbi","Celebrate with your group members":"K\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m v\u1edbi c\xe1c th\xe0nh vi\xean trong nh\xf3m c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n","Change Bible translation":"Thay \u0111\u1ed5i b\u1ea3n d\u1ecbch Kinh th\xe1nh","Change avatar":"Thay \u0111\u1ed5i \u1ea3nh \u0111\u1ea1i di\u1ec7n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n","Change conversation name":"Thay \u0111\u1ed5i t\xean cu\u1ed9c tr\xf2 chuy\u1ec7n","Change goal":"Thay \u0111\u1ed5i m\u1ee5c ti\xeau","Change group name":"Thay \u0111\u1ed5i t\xean nh\xf3m","Change group picture":"Thay \u0111\u1ed5i h\xecnh \u1ea3nh nh\xf3m","Change language":"Thay \u0111\u1ed5i t\xf9y ch